eon said he closed it on Jul 1. I can't tell from these sources whether it's one ticket or a reused or mistyped number. Please check the support system before the steering committee.\n- **Hartford:** the Aug 3 Moss digest describes the Hartford Sev 1 but gives no ticket number.\n- **Other digests:** the remaining digests have no Vantorre Group ticket numbers.\n- **Coverage:** I read only the #strategic-pod channel, #inc-vtg-hartford and the Moss digest files. I didn't check the support system itself."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
